Usage: run [options]

Options:
  -v, --verbose            print extra detail
  -q, --quiet              suppress normal output
  --color MODE             control terminal color [choices: auto, always, never]
  --config-dir CONFIG_DIR  directory for the CLI config file [default: cli-config] [precedence: flag > env > default] [env: CLI_CONFIG_DIR]
  demo                     run every library part once with deterministic fixtures
  config                   write and read the config file
  add                      append one note to the config directory
  search                   search a recursive root with its .gitignore
  process                  launch, stream, pipe, close stdin, and inspect process receipts
  eof                      exercise the child EOF path
  records                  decode, filter, sort, and print typed CSV records
  env                      overlay one child environment and inspect a failed receipt
  flags                    show ten typed options and their defaults
  exit                     exit with the exact requested status code
  --help                   show this help
  --version                show version

